.TH "LARGESTCONTENTFULPAINT.PAINTTIME" "3JS" "March 27, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
LargestContentfulPaint.paintTime \- LargestContentfulPaint: paintTime
property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]paintTime\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]LargestContentfulPaint\f[R] interface returns the
\f[CR]timestamp\f[R] when the rendering phase ended and the paint phase
started.
.PP
The \f[CR]paintTime\f[R] is broadly interoperable: The value should be
the same across different implementations.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]DOMHighResTimeStamp\f[R].
.SH EXAMPLES
See Observing separate paint and presentation timings.
.SH SEE ALSO
.IP \(bu 2
